01:08:49.127 --> 01:08:50.822
Intruder alert. Intruder alert.


01:10:19.818 --> 01:10:22.685
Mr Grin, πήρατε άδεια.


01:10:33.898 --> 01:10:35.729
Sabina, remember to keep
your heels down.


01:10:51.516 --> 01:10:52.414
Mr Grin?


01:10:53.885 --> 01:10:54.943
Mr Grin?


01:10:56.421 --> 01:11:00.551
